  "title": "Replace deprecated QDateTime methods with QTimeZone",
  "description": "This merge request updates deprecated Qt 6.8 methods in `qcustomplot.cpp`.\n\nChanges:\n- Replaced `QDateTime::toTimeSpec(Qt::TimeSpec)` with `toTimeZone(QTimeZone::systemTimeZone())`\n- Replaced `QDate::startOfDay(Qt::TimeSpec)` with `startOfDay(QTimeZone::systemTimeZone())`\n\nThese changes remove deprecation warnings shown in CI builds:\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/jobs/8391898341#L4405\n\nLet me know if another timezone (e.g. UTC) would be more appropriate.\n\nCloses #20230",
